{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_zaahen": {
        "attack": "【附加包】长刀横扫。<#ff9028ff>不落之志<>：每次伤害打中英雄叠1层果决（攻击力+1.5–2.95%随等级，最多12层，叠满翻倍）；叠满时受到致命伤害就倒下：<#ffb900ff>4秒<>无敌，回到最大生命30–75%再站起（冷却<#ffb900ff>300–120秒<>，随等级）。",
        "skill": "【附加包】两连斩，每斩<#ff9028ff>38<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>105%<>物理伤害，第一斩打中英雄回复最大生命5–9%（别的单位一半）。<#ffb900ff>5.5秒<>内再按：上挑造成<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<>并<#ef5350ff>击飞<><#ffb900ff>0.75秒<>。",
        "skill2": "【附加包】刺出长刀：<#ff9028ff>62<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>62%<>物理伤害；到头再受<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>38%<>、<#ef5350ff>晕眩<><#ffb900ff>0.25秒<>并往回拽一段。<#ff9028ff>赤金突袭<>（每<#ffb900ff>9秒<>）：冲向英雄绕身斩<#ff9028ff>88<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>88%<>，外圈+50%并加最大生命5%魔法伤害。",
        "ult": "【附加包】展翼升空（免控、受到伤害-50%），冲向敌方英雄插刀落地：周围敌人受到<#ff9028ff>250<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>225%<>物理伤害，每打中一个英雄回复<#7ae582ff>83<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7ae582ff>74%<>。被动：攻击无视10–30%护甲（随等级）。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_zaahen": {
        "attack": "【附加包】長刀橫掃。<#ff9028ff>邪心修真<>：每次傷害打中英雄疊1層決心（攻擊力+1.5–2.95%隨等級，最多12層，疊滿翻倍）；疊滿時受到致命傷害就倒下：<#ffb900ff>4秒<>無敵，回到最大生命30–75%再站起（冷卻<#ffb900ff>300–120秒<>，隨等級）。",
        "skill": "【附加包】兩連斬，每斬<#ff9028ff>38<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>105%<>物理傷害，第一斬打中英雄回復最大生命5–9%（其他單位一半）。<#ffb900ff>5.5秒<>內再按：上挑造成<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<>並<#ef5350ff>擊飛<><#ffb900ff>0.75秒<>。",
        "skill2": "【附加包】刺出長刀：<#ff9028ff>62<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>62%<>物理傷害；到頭再受<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>38%<>、<#ef5350ff>暈眩<><#ffb900ff>0.25秒<>並往回拽一段。<#ff9028ff>偃月天衝<>（每<#ffb900ff>9秒<>）：衝向英雄繞身斬<#ff9028ff>88<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>88%<>，外圈+50%並加最大生命5%魔法傷害。",
        "ult": "【附加包】展翼升空（免控、受到傷害-50%），衝向敵方英雄插刀落地：周圍敵人受到<#ff9028ff>250<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>225%<>物理傷害，每打中一個英雄回復<#7ae582ff>83<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7ae582ff>74%<>。被動：攻擊無視10–30%護甲（隨等級）。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_zaahen": {
        "attack": "[Add-on] Glaive sweeps. <#ff9028ff>Cultivation of War<>: every damage instance on a champion stacks Determination (+1.5-2.95% attack each by level, up to 12, doubled when full); full, lethal damage fells him instead: <#ffb900ff>4s<> invulnerable and untargetable, back to 30–75% max health, he rises with Determination full (cooldown <#ffb900ff>300–120s<> by level).",
        "skill": "[Add-on] Slashes twice, <#ff9028ff>38<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>105%<> physical damage each; the first heals 5–9% max health on a champion (half on other units). Recast within <#ffb900ff>5.5s<>: an uppercut for <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> that <#ef5350ff>knocks up<> for <#ffb900ff>0.75s<>.",
        "skill2": "[Add-on] Stabs the glaive forward: <#ff9028ff>62<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>62%<> physical damage; at full length <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>38%<> more, <#ef5350ff>stuns<> for <#ffb900ff>0.25s<> and pulls a short way back. <#ff9028ff>Aureate Rush<> (every <#ffb900ff>9s<>): he dashes at a champion and spins for <#ff9028ff>88<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>88%<>, the outer edge 50% more and 5% max health magic damage.",
        "ult": "[Add-on] Rises on his wings (crowd-control immune, 50% less damage taken) and dives on an enemy champion, driving the glaive into the ground: enemies around take <#ff9028ff>250<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>225%<> physical damage; he heals <#7ae582ff>83<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7ae582ff>74%<> per champion hit. Passive: his hits ignore 10–30% armour (by level)."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_zaahen": {
        "attack": "[확장] 글레이브 휩쓸기. <#ff9028ff>전쟁 단련<>: 챔피언에게 피해를 줄 때마다 결의 1중첩(공격력 +1.5-2.95%, 레벨 비례, 최대 12, 최대면 2배); 최대일 때 치명적인 피해를 받으면 쓰러져 <#ffb900ff>4초<> 무적, 최대 체력 30–75%로 일어나 결의 최대(재사용 대기 <#ffb900ff>300–120초<>, 레벨 비례).",
        "skill": "[확장] 두 번 벰: 한 번에 <#ff9028ff>38<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>105%<> 물리 피해, 첫 베기 챔피언 적중 시 최대 체력 5–9% 회복(다른 유닛은 절반). <#ffb900ff>5.5초<> 안에 재사용: 올려 베기로 <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> 피해와 <#ffb900ff>0.75초<> <#ef5350ff>에어본<>.",
        "skill2": "[확장] 글레이브로 찌름: <#ff9028ff>62<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>62%<> 물리 피해; 끝에서 <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>38%<>, <#ffb900ff>0.25초<> <#ef5350ff>기절<>, 조금 끌어당김. <#ff9028ff>찬란한 쇄도<>(<#ffb900ff>9초<>마다): 챔피언에게 돌진해 <#ff9028ff>88<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>88%<> 회전 베기, 바깥 가장자리 50% 추가와 최대 체력 5% 마법 피해.",
        "ult": "[확장] 날개를 펴고 솟아올라(군중 제어 면역, 받는 피해 -50%) 적 챔피언에게 내리꽂음: 주변 적에게 <#ff9028ff>250<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>225%<> 물리 피해, 챔피언 적중마다 <#7ae582ff>83<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7ae582ff>74%<> 회복. 기본 지속 효과: 방어구 10–30% 관통(레벨 비례)."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_zaahen": {
        "attack": "【拡張】グレイヴで薙ぎ払う。<#ff9028ff>戦威修養<>：チャンピオンへのダメージ毎に決意1スタック（攻撃力+1.5–2.95%レベル比例、最大12、最大で2倍）；最大時に致命傷を受けると倒れ<#ffb900ff>4秒<>無敵、最大体力30–75%で立ち上がる（CD<#ffb900ff>300–120秒<>レベル比例）。",
        "skill": "【拡張】2回斬る：1回<#ff9028ff>38<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>105%<>の物理ダメージ、1回目のチャンピオン命中で最大体力5–9%回復（他は半分）。<#ffb900ff>5.5秒<>内に再使用：斬り上げで<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<>と<#ffb900ff>0.75秒<><#ef5350ff>ノックアップ<>。",
        "skill2": "【拡張】グレイヴを突き出す：<#ff9028ff>62<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>62%<>の物理ダメージ；伸び切ると<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>38%<>、<#ffb900ff>0.25秒<><#ef5350ff>スタン<>で少し引き寄せ。<#ff9028ff>絢爛たる進撃<>（<#ffb900ff>9秒<>毎）：チャンピオンへ突進し回転斬り<#ff9028ff>88<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>88%<>、外縁は50%増と最大体力5%の魔法ダメージ。",
        "ult": "【拡張】翼を広げて舞い上がり（CC無効、被ダメージ-50%）、敵チャンピオンへ降下して突き立てる：周囲の敵に<#ff9028ff>250<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>225%<>の物理ダメージ、チャンピオン1体ごとに<#7ae582ff>83<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7ae582ff>74%<>回復。自動効果：物理防御10–30%貫通（レベル比例）。"
      }
    }
  }
}
